---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---
<Base title="About Southwala" description="Who is behind Southwala, what we cover across the five southern states, and how our AI-assisted newsroom and human editor work.">
  <div class="page">
    <h1>About Southwala</h1>
    <p>Southwala is a news and culture site for the five southern states, for people who grew up on Instagram reels, filter coffee, biryani debates and fan wars. We cover politics with data and records, cinema, OTT, sport and the internet moments everyone is talking about in Andhra Pradesh, Telangana, Karnataka, Tamil Nadu and Kerala. Each state gets its own desk and its own tone, and we treat every party the same way.</p>
    <h2>How we work</h2>
    <p>Southwala runs as an AI-assisted newsroom with a human editor. AI helps us watch the news, summarise it and draft stories quickly. Our <a href="/team/">state desk bylines</a> are AI-assisted editorial voices, not human reporters in the field. Every story follows our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>, cites its sources, and politically sensitive stories are checked by a human before they go live.</p>
    <h2>Why we exist</h2>
    <p>Most South India coverage is either too serious to share or too shallow to trust. We want to be the page you open to understand what happened, why it matters, and what people are saying, in two minutes.</p>
    <h2>Talk to us</h2>
    <p>Tips, corrections, complaints and collaborations: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
